# The repository is stored with LF and checked out with LF on every platform.
#
# Why this file exists: the 2026-09 Windows -> Linux host migration copied a
# working tree that had been checked out under `core.autocrlf=true`, so every
# tracked text file landed on the Linux box with CRLF while the blobs behind
# them are LF. Git reported 181 files as fully rewritten (91,840 insertions and
# 91,840 deletions, mode unchanged) — a diff made entirely of line endings,
# which buries any real change and makes a surgical `git add` impossible.
# Pinning `eol=lf` makes the checkout deterministic regardless of the local
# `core.autocrlf`, so the failure cannot recur on a future host move.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
